Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.91,0:00:04.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是奧布聯合首長國首相
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:06.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.64,0:00:08.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:12.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布軍 立刻停止戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤軍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.87,0:00:23.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見人就砍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.51,0:00:25.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,混帳 別太得意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:26.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:28.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你要做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:30.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:38.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢對我…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:44.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別礙事！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.99,0:00:51.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,海涅！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚く散った光が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び覚ます
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみは音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,消えるあの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深く愛する
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣と希望強く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感じるこの記憶が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絡み合う心と
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ココロをつないで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,動き出している
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輝く光が照らし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び起こす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,響きあう音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,刻むこの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,永久に信じ続けて…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.51,0:02:31.35,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(644,632)}{\fad(500,500)}馬爾馬拉海 塔魯基烏斯港
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.35,0:02:33.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,材料會很快從迪奧基亞運來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:36.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但因為是Tannhauser發射前的瞬間中彈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:40.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦首的受損相當大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:46.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這下可得花不少時間啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:53.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之拜託你們盡快吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:56.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總是只能說這種話 真抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:59.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我們明白 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:13.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼海涅 維斯汀夫盧斯的遺物就由我們接管
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:30.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪他們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.51,0:03:33.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要不是他們莫名其妙插一腳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:34.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,海涅也不會…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.59,0:03:35.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:37.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底算什麼 那些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:39.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼要阻止戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:43.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那真的是Archangel和Freedom？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:46.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布到底在搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:48.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:52.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:05.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那你想和哪邊打？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:09.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這樣嗎 想開點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:14.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是戰爭　我們是軍人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.77,0:04:23.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不然　會死哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:24.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:56.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 那艘船的去向？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:04:57.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:02.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想必艦長也有所知
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.89,0:05:04.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我在上次大戰中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.39,0:05:10.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,曾在雅金 多維和那艘船並肩與ZAFT作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:15.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕那架MS Freedom的駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.78,0:05:17.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel的乘員
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:21.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及那個自稱是奧布的首相的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:24.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我熟識的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:29.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正因如此 更使我無法理解現在的情勢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:32.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或者說 無法接受
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:37.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實我也這麼認為
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:43.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們的目的是使加入地球軍的奧布停止戰鬥及撤軍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.14,0:05:44.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:49.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為不用那種方式 不需要這種犧牲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:51.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也還有其他手段
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.63,0:05:56.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們或許並不了解某些情況
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:05:59.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許誤會了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:03.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然 司令部和總部可能都會有所行動
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:05.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但若是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:09.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和他們交涉 尋找解決問題的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的職責
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.25,0:06:17.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…身為ZAFT FAITH的判斷嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.61,0:06:19.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:25.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也無權阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:33.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也認為那確實是無謂的戰鬥 無謂的犧牲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:38.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然若那樣和地球軍繼續交戰下去 情況不知道會變成怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:42.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:44.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我允許你離艦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:47.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 你一個人可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:51.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.11,0:07:03.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:07.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:08.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 查 巴勒路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:09.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能打擾嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:11.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請進
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:07:59.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米莉雅麗亞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:02.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米莉雅麗亞 赫？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:07.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:13.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？所以開戰後就回不了奧布那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:15.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而回了ZAFT?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:19.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 簡而言之就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:24.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在那邊也碰到了堤亞哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:30.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先別說這個 關於Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:34.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然知道那艘船離開了奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:36.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟怎麼會再出現在這裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:40.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪他們介入 弄得一片…呃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:42.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,混亂？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.42,0:08:46.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 我也全部看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:56.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 你找Archangel打算怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和他們談談
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:02.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當面談談
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:04.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和基拉 還有卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在 作為ZAFT？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:08.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:14.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 辦法也不是沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:17.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以你個人名義的話 我可以幫忙聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:22.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很久沒回奧布了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.09,0:09:25.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,詳情也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:29.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其實誰都不希望這種事發生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:32.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉也一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.59,0:09:49.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…怎麼辦好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:52.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:10:02.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛 前幾天的戰鬥算是表明了我們的立場吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:09.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是這下ZAFT的注意力也會再轉回我們身上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:12.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,形勢嚴峻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:14.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:24.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼 拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:25.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:29.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你看起來一臉沉重
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.92,0:10:33.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:40.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在想…這樣好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:44.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先下決心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:47.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再去行動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:10.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是想成就某事時的唯一途徑 一定是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:12.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.57,0:11:15.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:18.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:52.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,偵察任務？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.59,0:11:53.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.51,0:11:57.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是司令部發來的正式命令
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:02.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,根據當地居民提供的情報
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:08.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個凹地裡有聯合至關重要的不明研究設施
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在雖然很安靜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:15.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以前經常有車輛飛機和MS出入
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:17.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是有相當規模的設施
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:21.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你們明晨前往調查
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:26.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們去幹這種活？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.34,0:12:27.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真！適可而止
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:30.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種活？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.32,0:12:34.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有武裝勢力佔據那裡怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.91,0:12:37.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,任務就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:39.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,交給你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:40.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.13,0:13:02.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:06.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在達達尼爾海峽看見了天使
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:08.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望能再見面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.09,0:13:11.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,紅色的騎士在尋找公主
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:12.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.53,0:13:14.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米莉雅麗亞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.18,0:13:16.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米莉雅麗亞？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.01,0:13:18.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,紅色的騎士？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:23.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:28.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是從終端轉過來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:29.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:32.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在達達尼爾海峽看見了天使…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.97,0:13:35.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那米莉雅麗亞也在那裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:38.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她現在應該是自由報導攝影師
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:41.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在場也不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:42.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:45.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭回來了 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:48.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從PLANT回來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:51.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:57.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,陷阱的話有點過於拐彎抹角了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:14:00.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過米莉雅麗亞她…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:03.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她應該知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:06.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,直接聯繫Archangel的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.15,0:14:09.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:12.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:18.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭回來的話也能知道很多PLANT的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.69,0:14:23.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但Archangel不要出動
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:25.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我一個人去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:29.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係 不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:31.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:34.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以 那我和卡嘉莉去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:34.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:36.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:54.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.63,0:15:58.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米莉雅麗亞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:03.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不敢相信 看到Freedom的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:09.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然聽說劫了新娘離開奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:11.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:14.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比起這些 阿斯蘭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.10,0:16:20.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 保險起見沒有直接聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:22.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他回歸ZAFT了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.24,0:16:24.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:25.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭他？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.12,0:16:31.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那架機體
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.18,0:16:55.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:16:57.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:02.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事 阿斯蘭你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:08.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直 一直在擔心你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.89,0:17:12.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,變成那樣 也沒能聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:14.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:17.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼又回到ZAFT去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:22.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當時我認為這樣比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.55,0:17:26.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了自己也為了奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:29.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:30.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼為了奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:31.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:33.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.14,0:17:42.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你的機體？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:44.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:47.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那上次戰鬥…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.81,0:17:51.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也在場 因為現在在Minerva上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.47,0:17:59.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看見你想聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.59,0:18:02.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但沒能連通
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.23,0:18:04.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但為什麼做那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.28,0:18:06.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種傻事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.39,0:18:10.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓戰場一片混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.16,0:18:13.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你 出現了不必要的犧牲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.18,0:18:18.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傻事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.39,0:18:24.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那時 ZAFT想要攻擊的可是奧布軍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:27.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們正是想…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:31.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,妳真以為妳在那裡出現奧布軍就會撤退嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:35.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,妳該做的不是這種事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:38.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出現在戰場說那些話之前
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:42.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就不該讓奧布參加同盟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:43.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:52.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:18:57.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這樣一來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:02.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你現在又成為ZAFT軍的話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:05.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後打算怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:08.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼在找我們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:09.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 那是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:11.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為想阻止你們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.32,0:19:13.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別再做那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.52,0:19:16.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Junius 7的事雖然我也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.19,0:19:20.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之後的混亂怎麼看都是聯合不對
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.71,0:19:26.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而PLANT為早日結束這些正拼命努力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.26,0:19:28.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你們卻…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:31.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道不只是在搞亂情況嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.09,0:19:34.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:37.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT真的這麼想嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.81,0:19:40.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個狄蘭達爾議長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:46.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想趕快結束戰爭 回到和平的世界？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:50.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也看到議長的所作所為了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.48,0:19:52.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也聽到他說的話了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:54.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長真的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:57.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 那個拉克絲 克萊茵呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:02.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在PLANT的那個拉克絲怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:04.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.55,0:20:10.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且為什麼真正的她險些被協調者殺害？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:44.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,險些被殺？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:46.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:54.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在奧布我們被協調者的特種部隊和MS襲擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.09,0:20:58.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標是拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:02.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我又坐上了Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.35,0:21:03.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:09.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為不想讓她和大家任何人死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.87,0:21:15.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是誰 為什麼要取她性命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:19.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要不水落石出
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.41,0:21:21.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我就無法相信PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.95,0:21:23.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.54,0:21:43.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是什麼地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:52.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:54.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.97,0:22:01.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！怎麼了 雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:07.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,涙で滲んだ  この時空を  見上げるたび
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚い蒼さが  胸を締めつけてく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,運命なら  哀しみの果てまで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戦い続けた  日々を跡に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　燃え上がる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命がある限り
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真実の自分さえ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見失いそう　それでも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　守りたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,心は砕かれて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本当の哀しみを知った瞳は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,愛に溢れて....
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.21,0:23:24.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真相只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.95,0:23:26.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事實不可動搖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.12,0:23:28.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這行為的意義是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.30,0:23:30.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,語言的深意是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.41,0:23:32.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這些無從知曉的事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.15,0:23:35.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直被深深埋在心中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.09,0:23:39.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能說和不能說的真相到底在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.91,0:23:43.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集　機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.67,0:23:45.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,罪之所在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.59,0:23:49.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向碰撞的現在開炮 Gaia
